- Code boilerplate goes to `templates/<File>.example`, never pasted here.
- Long reference goes to `references/<theme>.md`, which loads only on invocation.
- A new rule is a file in `rules/` — don't write it inside this skill.
- `paths` only if there's real territory; otherwise delete the field.
- A skill that writes files in the user's project gets
  `disable-model-invocation: true` — use the other exemplar.
